04:46.187 --> 04:48.897
Teal, Paul! Distract the big guy!

04:48.897 --> 04:51.237
Wh-What do you expect us to do?

04:51.237 --> 04:55.407
That thing will kill me 
if I attack it with magic!

04:56.347 --> 04:59.117
If Gowtan goes down, we're all dead!

04:59.377 --> 05:01.247
We need a path to victory!

05:15.257 --> 05:17.927
<b>Status Effect
 Paralysis</b>

05:15.777 --> 05:17.927
<i>Status effect: paralysis.</i>

05:28.817 --> 05:29.737
Parry!

05:38.967 --> 05:40.417
I'll draw it to me!

05:41.177 --> 05:46.627
Teal, get Gowtan, and cast Heal
 and Paralysis Heal on him!

05:44.377 --> 05:46.627
Heal [Support Skill]

05:44.957 --> 05:46.627
Paralysis Heal [Support Skill]

05:46.627 --> 05:49.627
I have Heal, but I don't have 
Paralysis Heal.

05:49.627 --> 05:52.467
I used my skill points 
to increase my attack!

05:52.467 --> 05:54.467
I can't cure paralysis!

05:54.467 --> 05:57.757
<i>What kind of half-assed build is that?</i>

05:58.077 --> 06:01.807
In any case, take Gowtan 
to a safe place and heal him!

06:01.807 --> 06:03.067
Run!

06:03.067 --> 06:04.787
G-Got it.

06:08.997 --> 06:15.017
<i>People recover from a Mad Headder's
 poison after three minutes on average.</i>

06:15.907 --> 06:18.047
<i>If I can survive until then...</i>

06:20.987 --> 06:23.707
<i>Teal's Heal will put 
Gowtan back in the fight.</i>

06:23.707 --> 06:24.697
Heal.

06:25.497 --> 06:30.977
<i>But I had no idea reality would be 
so different from the game.</i>

06:31.577 --> 06:34.297
<b>Monster: Mad Headder</b>

06:36.897 --> 06:42.727
I'll fight you until Gowtan rallies, 
Mad Headder!

06:45.847 --> 06:50.947
What? F-rank adventurers 
can't fight a monster like that.

06:50.947 --> 06:51.857
Idiot!

06:51.857 --> 06:53.987
Let's run while we can!

06:53.987 --> 06:56.647
Once he's dead, we're next!

06:57.957 --> 06:59.617
Wait for me!

06:59.617 --> 07:03.617
<i>That's fine. If they joined the fray, 
they wouldn't last ten seconds.</i>

07:03.617 --> 07:08.657
<i>I can't afford to defend low-rank 
adventurers while fighting this guy.</i>

07:24.727 --> 07:26.657
<i>I'm level 16.</i>

07:27.247 --> 07:30.437
<i>Meanwhile, the Mad Headder is level 40.</i>

07:30.717 --> 07:33.567
<i>A single mistake means death!</i>

08:52.177 --> 08:56.397
<i>Our level difference is too great. 
This situation blows.</i>

08:56.397 --> 09:00.697
<i>I didn't think I'd face such a powerful 
opponent unprepared.</i>

09:01.627 --> 09:04.677
<i>I wanted to avoid this situation.</i>

09:05.567 --> 09:07.917
<i>It's high-risk, high-return.</i>

09:07.917 --> 09:11.647
<i>It's testing the limits of my abilities.</i>

09:12.607 --> 09:15.347
<i>I wouldn't be a man 
if this didn't get my blood pumping!</i>

09:24.597 --> 09:29.817
Is that Heavy Knight holding
 his own against that monster

09:29.817 --> 09:31.447
that knocked down Mr. Gowtan?

09:31.447 --> 09:34.227
Don't be stupid. He's just slowly losing.

09:34.517 --> 09:36.777
It's a miracle he's not dead yet.

09:45.957 --> 09:51.847
<i>If I keep letting the Mad Headder attack, 
it'll land a blow eventually.</i>

09:52.707 --> 09:56.497
<i>I need to strike back to keep it in check.</i>

09:53.457 --> 09:56.287
<b>Remaining skill points: 5</b>

09:53.457 --> 09:57.417
<b>Oath of the Heavy Armor
 


\hDefense Booster




\hBeginner Swordsmanship</b>

