<b>Vital Slice [Common Skill]
 Land a heavy blow with a blade from zero distance
 Effective against targets with high Defense</b>

10:05.797 --> 10:08.587
<i>Land a heavy blow with a blade 
from zero distance.</i>

10:08.587 --> 10:12.097
<i>Effective against targets 
with high Defense.</i>

10:14.497 --> 10:15.597
Okay!

10:21.267 --> 10:22.247
Parry!

10:31.077 --> 10:32.427
<i>Now!</i>

10:34.787 --> 10:37.247
<b>Vital Slice</b>

10:34.967 --> 10:36.407
Vital Slice!

10:55.157 --> 10:57.727
<i>Vital Slice sacrifices 
the reach of the blade.</i>

10:57.727 --> 10:59.857
<i>Because of that, 
it was considered defective.</i>

11:00.707 --> 11:03.307
<i>But its effectiveness at dealing damage</i>

11:03.307 --> 11:07.247
<i>works for the low-attack, 
high-defense Heavy Knight.</i>

11:08.367 --> 11:11.867
<i>However, this won't be enough to beat it.</i>

11:20.857 --> 11:22.497
It's attacking wildly!

11:26.007 --> 11:30.517
That's right, Mad Headder. 
The real fight starts now!

11:30.517 --> 11:31.577
But...

11:32.817 --> 11:35.307
my job is done.

11:53.067 --> 11:54.697
It's attacking wildly!

11:58.207 --> 12:02.687
That's right, Mad Headder. 
The real fight starts now!

12:02.687 --> 12:03.857
But...

12:04.937 --> 12:07.127
my job is done.

12:18.757 --> 12:21.427
Dragonslayer Split!

12:34.897 --> 12:36.287
Yes!

12:51.637 --> 12:55.307
<i>Level has increased 
from level 16 to level 23.</i>

12:56.397 --> 13:04.407
<i>A mere F-rank adventurer survived 
against a monster that nearly killed me?</i>

13:05.437 --> 13:07.117
I had just reached my limit.

13:07.557 --> 13:09.567
Thanks, Gowtan.

13:21.317 --> 13:23.037
I'm sorry, Elymas!

13:24.667 --> 13:28.247
My leadership was inadequate, 
and I was careless.

13:28.247 --> 13:31.087
You were right about everything.

13:31.867 --> 13:32.877
Gowtan?

13:33.947 --> 13:36.337
You should take that.

13:41.767 --> 13:45.707
<i>A level 40 Magic Stone? 
I bet it's pretty valuable.</i>

13:45.707 --> 13:48.277
<i>Honestly, I'd be glad 
to take it since I'm broke.</i>

13:50.687 --> 13:51.987
Are you sure?

13:51.987 --> 13:55.897
Yeah. You defeated that monster.

14:00.477 --> 14:04.327
That rare level 40 monster 
dropped an item.

14:05.497 --> 14:07.287
Do you want it?

14:07.287 --> 14:08.237
What?

14:08.547 --> 14:11.947
Don't be ridiculous. 
I don't go back on my word.

14:11.947 --> 14:14.297
You defeated that monster.

14:16.847 --> 14:20.907
C-Could I just check the item description?

14:22.117 --> 14:23.947
Uh, sure.

14:33.947 --> 14:35.217
<i>Daemonsrage Shield.</i>

14:35.217 --> 14:39.977
<i>+25 defense. Market price:
 three million gold.</i>

14:35.317 --> 14:45.957
<b>\h\h\h\h\hDaemonsrage Shield
\h\h+25 Defense
\h\hMarket Price: 3,000,000 gold
 After blocking an attack, your next 
attack receives a +8 bonus</b>

14:39.977 --> 14:45.957
<i>After blocking an attack, your next
attack receives a +8 bonus.</i>

14:46.487 --> 14:49.707
<i>A rare drop worth three million gold?</i>

14:50.427 --> 14:55.497
<i>Rampart Reflection only activates when 
my armor's struck, but with these stats,</i>

14:55.497 --> 14:58.717
<i>I could shut down attacks 
around my level with just this shield.</i>

14:59.467 --> 15:03.627
<i>But if I sold something this valuable, 
it would attract attention.</i>

15:03.627 --> 15:05.977
Three million gold, huh?

15:15.407 --> 15:16.967
So, Gowtan,

15:17.357 --> 15:19.487
about my promotion...

15:19.487 --> 15:21.367
Don't worry.

15:21.777 --> 15:26.687
I'll tell the guild it'll be their loss 
if they don't promote you.

15:27.617 --> 15:30.427
They'd better promote you ASAP.

15:30.427 --> 15:31.797
Really?

15:32.277 --> 15:36.087
The guild told me to make sure 
you didn't cheat,

15:36.557 --> 15:39.147
but their warning was misguided.

15:39.147 --> 15:39.927
What?

15:40.337 --> 15:44.927
If anyone opposes it, I'll knock them out.

15:45.317 --> 15:46.207
What?!

15:52.307 --> 15:53.977
U-Um...

15:54.677 --> 15:56.397
Excuse me, Mr. Gowtan...

15:56.827 --> 16:01.447
Do you think you could 
approve my promotion?

16:01.747 --> 16:05.567
It was my Heal that 
got you back on your feet.

16:05.567 --> 16:06.707
Teal!

16:06.707 --> 16:11.677
You completely lost your nerve 
against that monster.

16:11.677 --> 16:14.707
I can't approve your promotion.

16:15.267 --> 16:19.367
You'll encounter far greater 
challenges in dungeons.

16:20.027 --> 16:22.947
Go train with some quests you can handle!

17:58.807 --> 18:01.597
Here's your reward 
for completing the raid.

18:02.277 --> 18:05.277
First, you'll receive 130,000 gold.

18:07.877 --> 18:09.687
Also...

18:10.987 --> 18:15.167
you'll receive 200,000 gold 
for ten Wight Magic Stones.

18:17.077 --> 18:18.867
Finally...

18:18.867 --> 18:19.707
There's more?

18:20.317 --> 18:24.577
There's the Ghoul Head 
turned Mad Headder Magic Stone.

18:25.917 --> 18:27.717
That's worth 600,000 gold.

18:31.177 --> 18:34.507
You actually made more than me this time.

18:34.507 --> 18:36.397
Raids are good money.

18:36.877 --> 18:38.577
That's a ton of gold.

18:38.577 --> 18:40.407
He made more than Mr. Gowtan?

18:41.007 --> 18:43.357
Isn't he a Heavy Knight?

18:44.057 --> 18:49.907
Mr. Gowtan, did this man really 
defeat the Ghoul Head variant?

18:49.907 --> 18:55.167
Didn't he raise eyebrows when he 
brought in high-level Magic Stones before?

18:55.617 --> 18:57.627
He must be using a trick.

18:57.627 --> 18:58.997
What's his level?

18:58.997 --> 19:01.367
Defensive classes are defective.

19:00.277 --> 19:03.427
Well, uh, actually...

19:01.367 --> 19:04.127
Mr. Gowtan, say something.

19:05.007 --> 19:10.097
Yeah, how does a defensive class 
like Heavy Knight kill that many monsters?

19:14.387 --> 19:17.707
You doubt Elymas?

19:17.707 --> 19:22.607
Then you're insulting me 
for approving his promotion!

19:31.907 --> 19:34.797
Thanks for everything, Gowtan. 
I appreciate it.

19:34.797 --> 19:35.657
Sure.

19:36.887 --> 19:38.747
Let's meet again. Take care.

19:38.427 --> 19:42.987
<i>Gowtan instantly stopped everyone
from talking behind my back,</i>

19:38.747 --> 19:39.437
Yeah.

19:42.987 --> 19:46.877
<i>and I was promoted to rank E.</i>

19:55.387 --> 19:58.507
Hey, you. Wanna team up 
with a dependable front liner?

19:58.507 --> 19:59.897
Are you sure you're strong?

20:00.787 --> 20:04.227
<i>What should I do now?</i>

20:05.397 --> 20:11.197
<i>At rank E, I can enter dungeons. 
I could farm gold there.</i>

20:11.917 --> 20:17.057
<i>But the Rampart Reflection strat 
that requires overwhelming defense</i>

20:17.057 --> 20:18.577
<i>only works against starter enemies.</i>

20:19.197 --> 20:25.087
<i>With my current skill setup, 
I'll be stuck grinding levels for a while.</i>

20:26.237 --> 20:30.607
<i>Maybe I'll try looking for that 
to set my course.</i>

20:35.027 --> 20:38.097
<i>A Fang of Smoldering
 Insanity skillbook.</i>

20:35.427 --> 20:43.107
<b>Fang of 
Smoldering Insanity</b>

20:36.847 --> 20:43.107
<b>Skillbook</b>

20:38.097 --> 20:42.667
<i>Skillbooks are items required 
to unlock skill trees.</i>

20:43.497 --> 20:47.107
<i>They're rare, 
so I won't find one right away,</i>

20:47.707 --> 20:49.787
<i>but looking for one is free.</i>

20:51.107 --> 20:53.367
<b>Remaining skill points: 5</b>

20:51.107 --> 20:53.367
<b>Oath of the Heavy Armor</b>

20:51.107 --> 20:53.367
<b>Defense Booster</b>

20:51.107 --> 20:53.367
<b>Beginner Swordsmanship</b>

20:51.747 --> 20:55.167
<i>Oath of the Heavy Armor 
and Fang of Smoldering Insanity.</i>

20:56.377 --> 21:00.637
<i>These two skill trees work together 
to complete the Heavy Knight.</i>

21:01.757 --> 21:06.487
<i>The completed Heavy Knight 
is no longer a defense specialist.</i>

21:06.487 --> 21:09.377
<i>Even calling it an offensive specialist
 isn't right either.</i>

21:09.377 --> 21:12.897
<i>It's a human weapon.</i>

21:14.597 --> 21:20.367
<i>Fang of Smoldering Insanity is essential
 to unlocking the Heavy Knight's potential.</i>

21:21.277 --> 21:22.327
<i>But...</i>

21:56.047 --> 21:59.557
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Krzysztof Kunc

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Sriram Gurunathan</b>

23:10.557 --> 23:16.007
<i>It was a close fight, but I managed 
to get promoted to rank E.</i>

23:16.007 --> 23:18.427
<i>My next step is clear.</i>

23:19.227 --> 23:21.547
<i>I'll become a true Heavy Knight.</i>

23:21.547 --> 23:28.767
<i>Neither a defensive nor offensive 
specialist, but a human weapon.</i>

23:29.147 --> 23:32.237
<i>And to do that, I need that skillbook.</i>

23:32.687 --> 23:34.607
<i>Next time, "Fang of Smoldering Insanity."</i>

23:35.697 --> 23:39.227
<i>Anyway, this is a shockingly 
expensive problem.</i>
